cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "MyMentorLLM analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Code that reproduces every table, figure and in-text result of the MyMentorLLM
  paper from the public dataset, and asserts each reproduced value against the
  published one. The dataset itself (2,100 simulated cognitive behavioural therapy
  sessions, 65,100 dialogue turns and 263.4 hours of spoken psychotherapy, in
  Italian) is distributed separately on Hugging Face.
